n{1,\\,t,\\,{t}^{2},\\,…,\\,{t}^{24}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have that \n\n$$\n\\text{dim}({R}_{24}[t])=24+1=25.\n$$\n\nIn general,\n\n$$\n\\text{dim}({R}_{n}[t])=n+1.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14072692/state.json" "file_sha256" "413fcdf6e3e7078d81e39d698dd046ae900e748b0d4d52c23c2b7257bd22941f"} {"question" "q-106868" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14072692/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7b4edd8ed1597cb536cb9241b96b7c0a341fd4c9f62309143d81a8332951561b"} {"question" "q-106868" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14072692/state.json" "file_sha256" "413fcdf6e3e7078d81e39d698dd046ae900e748b0d4d52c23c2b7257bd22941f"} {"question" "q-106868" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "12"] ["math" "24"] ["math" "25"] ["math" "48"] ["math" "6"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14072692/state.json" "file_sha256" "413fcdf6e3e7078d81e39d698dd046ae900e748b0d4d52c23c2b7257bd22941f"} {"question" "q-106868" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "25"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14072692/state.json" "file_sha256" "413fcdf6e3e7078d81e39d698dd046ae900e748b0d4d52c23c2b7257bd22941f"} {"question" "q-106867" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the dimension of ${R}_{2}[t]$, the vector space of all polynomials in the variable $t$ of degree at most $2?$" "